{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:af6a0436a1f649c6","name":"Droch-Class Boarding Ship","source":{"id":"source:reference-af6a0436a1f649c6","title":"Droch-Class Boarding Ship","revision":19879,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:46:59Z","sha256":"783582c2884abe0c76bb3cd6a026eb4d597a2f915b42fe6c0206c89535d02d16","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19879","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Droch-Class%20Boarding%20Ship&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-af6a0436a1f649c6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Confederacy likes to use captured enemy ships for covert missions. Toward this end, Separatist engineers design specialized boarding vessels that can transfer boarding parties to the interior of an enemy vessel without causing catastrophic damage to the ship itself. One such design is the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Droch"]},"-Class Boarding Ship, which can be launched in large numbers to capture enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," while still keeping them spaceworthy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Droch"]},"-Class Boarding Ship has a special Boarding Drill on its forward section that can be used to drill into a Starship and release its passengers safely in side the ship. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Droch"]},"-Class Boarding Ship can make an attack with the Boarding Drill against a ship in an adjacent square. If the attack succeeds, the Boarding Ship moves into the target's space and attaches itself to the hull of the target ship without triggering a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each round thereafter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," can use the Boarding Drill to make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check and deal damage to the target ship equal to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check's result, ignoring the target ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},". When the target ship has taken cumulative damage from the Boarding Drill in excess of its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", the Boarding Ship punches through and its passengers can enter the target ship safely.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Droch"]},"-Class Boarding Ship Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"refe